  "releaseNotes": "0.1.2: Appsettings engine — validate required JSON configuration paths from appsettings.json + appsettings.{Environment}.json. Compose is optional for non-Docker .NET apps. New finding codes CONFIG_PATH_MISSING, CONFIG_PATH_OPTIONAL_MISSING, CONFIG_PARSE. CLI --appsettings / --environment. Sample: samples/aspnet-appsettings.",
